{
 "name": "fidoria-terrain-autotile",
 "version": 2,
 "projection": "top-down (orthographic), tile persegi",
 "sizes": [
  512,
  128,
  64,
  32
 ],
 "default_size": 512,
 "method": "dual-grid (vertex autotile)",
 "how_it_works": [
  "Terrain disimpan per CELL di grid dunia (x = kolom, y = baris, y ke bawah).",
  "Tile digambar per VERTEX (titik pertemuan 4 cell), bukan per cell.",
  "Untuk vertex (vx,vy), 4 cell sekitarnya jadi 4 kuadran: NW=(vx-1,vy-1) NE=(vx,vy-1) SE=(vx,vy) SW=(vx-1,vy).",
  "Keempat kuadran sama -> tile base terrain itu.",
  "Ada 2 terrain dan pasangannya ada di \"pairs\": bikin mask 4 huruf urutan [NW,NE,SE,SW]; \"a\" = terrain a, \"b\" = terrain b; cari pairs[].tiles[mask].",
  "Mask diagonal (\"abab\"/\"baba\") tidak punya tile -> lihat \"fallback\"."
 ],
 "placement": {
  "formula": "px = vx*size - size/2 ; py = vy*size - size/2",
  "note": "(px,py) = pojok kiri-atas gambar tile. Tile vertex digeser setengah tile ke kiri-atas dari tile \"per cell\". Grid vertex berukuran (kolom+1) x (baris+1)."
 },
 "directions": "N = atas layar (-y), E = kanan (+x), S = bawah (+y), W = kiri (-x)",
 "terrains": {
  "grass": {
   "base": "{size}/base/grass.png"
  },
  "dirt": {
   "base": "{size}/base/dirt.png",
   "variants": [
    "{size}/base/dirt.png",
    "{size}/base/dirt_alt.png"
   ]
  },
  "sand": {
   "base": "{size}/base/sand.png"
  },
  "water": {
   "base": "{size}/base/water.png",
   "note": "base baru: master 256 (tanpa 512); 512 -> upscale 256 atau pakai 128/64/32",
   "max_base_size": 256
  },
  "cobblestone": {
   "base": "{size}/base/cobblestone.png",
   "note": "base baru: master 256 (tanpa 512); transisi ada ke dirt, grass, sand, water",
   "max_base_size": 256
  },
  "rocky": {
   "base": "{size}/base/rocky.png",
   "note": "base baru: master 256 (tanpa 512); transisi ada ke grass dan dirt",
   "max_base_size": 256
  }
 },
